f71a9df2bfa16cf\", \"image_id\": \"imagetemps-bb8af00c8cd811f1afd74d5d5fff1544\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3555183547087669, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.15849252101252417, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8152453, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7474.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"875d9f208a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7474.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7474.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 32141, \"chunk_count\": 21, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:06\", \"token_count\": 11686, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"SyncMeasure/NoView/ExemplarsEnabled/Float64Histogram/Attributes/0-24               431.0n ± 2%   116.3n ±  2%  -73.01% (p=0.002 n=6)\\n\\nSyncMeasure/NoView/ExemplarsEnabled/Float64Histogram/Attributes/10-24              470.9n ± 1%   171.0n ±  5%  -63.70% (p=0.002 n=6)\\n\\n```\\n\\nI explored using a []atomic.Pointer[measurement], but this had similar performance while being much more complex (needing a sync.Pool to eliminate allocations).  The single-threaded performance was also much worse for that solution.  See https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/compare/main...dashpole:optimize_histogram_reservoir_old.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-PR-05]\\n\\n# Pull Request: Optimize histogram reservoir (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go#7443)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7443  \\n\\n**Author**: dashpole  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-02T13:56:40Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-15T15:00:11Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: merged (2025-12-15T14:59:34Z)  \\n\\n**Branch**: `optimize_histogram_reservoir` → `main`  \\n\\n**C