\\n* fix(deps): update module github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/v2 to v2.4.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7277\\n\\n* fix(deps): update golang.org/x by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7188\\n\\n* fix(deps): update module github.com/opentracing-contrib/go-grpc to v0.1.2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7281\\n\\n* fix(deps): update googleapis to ef028d9 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7279\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/rogpeppe/go-internal to v1.14.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7283\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/spf13/pflag to v1.0.9 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7282\\n\\n* fix(deps): update github.com/opentracing-contrib/go-grpc/test digest to 0261db7 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7278\\n\\n* Fix missing link in changelog by @MrAlias in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7273\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z tag v1 39 0 publish 2025 12 08t16 45 46z what s chang drop support for go 123 by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7274 fix dep updat modul go opentelemetri io collector pdata to v1 400 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7275 chore dep updat modul github com securego gosec v2 to v2 22 8 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7276 fix dep updat modul github com golangci golangci lint v2 to v2 40 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7277 fix dep updat golang org x by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7188 fix dep updat modul github com opentrac contrib go grpc to v0 12 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7281 fix dep updat googleapi to ef028d9 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7279 chore dep updat modul github com rogpepp go intern to v1 14 1 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7283 chore dep updat modul github com spf13 pflag to v1 0 9 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7282 fix dep updat github com opentrac contrib go grpc test digest to 0261db7 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7278 fix miss link in changelog by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7273\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"2b3636dadf7f2a2a\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.36746012117042937, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.17144218738632763, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8248353, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Improve performance of histogram `Record` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric` when min and max are disabled using `NoMinMax`. (#7306)\\n\\n- Improve error handling for dropped data during translation by using `prometheus.NewInvalidMetric` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/prometheus`. ⚠️ **Breaking Change:** Previously, these cases were only logged and scrapes succeeded. Now, when translation would drop data (e.g., invalid label/value), the exporter emits a `NewInvalidMetric`, and Prometheus scrapes **fail with HTTP 500** by default. To preserve the prior behavior (scrapes succeed while errors are logged), configure your Prometheus HTTP handler with: `promhttp.HandlerOpts{ ErrorHandling: promhttp.ContinueOnError }`. (#7363)\\n\\n- Replace fnv hash with xxhash in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute` for better performance. (#7371)\\n\\n- The default `TranslationStrategy` in `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/prometheus` is changed from `otlptranslator.NoUTF8EscapingWithSuffixes` to `otlptranslator.UnderscoreEscapingWithSuffixes`. (#7421)\\n\\n- Improve performance of concurrent measurements in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7427)\\n\\n- Include W3C TraceFlags (bits 0–7) in the OTLP `Span.Flags` field in `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp` and `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7438)\\n\\n- The `ErrorType` function in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0` now handles custom error types.\\n\\n  If an error implements an `ErrorType() string` method, the return value of that method will be used as the error type. (#7442)\\n\\n### Fixed\\n\\n- Fix `WithInstrumentationAttributes` options in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/metric`, and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/log` to properly merge attributes when passed multiple times instead of replacing them. Attributes with duplicate keys will use the last value passed. (#7300)\\n\\n- The equality of `attribute.Set` when using the `Equal` method is not affected by the user overriding the empty set pointed to by `attribute.EmptySet` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute`. (#7357)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"improv perform of histogram record in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric when min and max are disabl use nominmax 7306 improv error handl for drop data dure translat by use prometheus newinvalidmetr in go opentelemetri io otel export prometheus break chang previous these case were onli log and scrape succeed now when translat would drop data e g invalid label valu the export emit a newinvalidmetr and prometheus scrape fail with http 500 by default to preserv the prior behavior scrape succeed while error are log configur your prometheus http handler with promhttp handleropt errorhandl promhttp continueonerror 7363 replac fnv hash with xxhash in go opentelemetri io otel attribut for better perform 7371 the default translationstrategi in go opentelemetri io export prometheus is chang from otlptransl noutf8escapingwithsuffixes to otlptransl underscoreescapingwithsuffix 7421 improv perform of concurr measur in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7427 includ w3c traceflag bit 0 7 in the otlp span flag field in go opentelemetri io export otlp otlptrac otlptracehttp and go opentelemetri io export otlp otlptrac otlptracegrpc 7438 the errortyp function in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 37 0 now handl custom error type if an error implement an errortyp string method the return valu of that method will be use a the error type 7442 fix fix withinstrumentationattribut option in go opentelemetri io otel trace go opentelemetri io otel metric and go opentelemetri io otel log to proper merg attribut when pass multipl time instead of replac them attribut with duplic key will use the last valu pass 7300 the equal of attribut set when use the equal method is not affect by the user overrid the empti set point to by attribut emptyset in go opentelemetri io otel attribut 7357\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"2fc8f714ea7b265d\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.35847383267187843, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1491614166741121, \"vector_similarity\": 0.84686947, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"* Don't track min and max when disabled by @dashpole in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7306\\n\\n* fix(deps): update golang.org/x by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7320\\n\\n* Add benchmark for exponential histogram measurements by @dashpole in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7305\\n\\n* chore(deps): update golang.org/x by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7324\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module mvdan.cc/gofumpt to v0.9.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7322\\n\\n* trace,metric,log: WithInstrumentationAttributes options to merge attributes by @pellared in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7300\\n\\n* Encapsulate observability in Logs SDK by @MrAlias in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7315\\n\\n* trace,metric,log: add WithInstrumentationAttributeSet option by @pellared in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7287\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/spf13/afero to v1.15.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7330\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/s