rvoir (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go#7443)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7443  \\n\\n**Author**: dashpole  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-02T13:56:40Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-15T15:00:11Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: merged (2025-12-15T14:59:34Z)  \\n\\n**Branch**: `optimize_histogram_reservoir` → `main`  \\n\\n**Changes**: +173 / -61 across 8 files  \\n\\n**Labels**: —  \\n\\n**Milestone**: v1.40.0\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Reviews (19)\\n\\n**MrAlias** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T16:04:21Z\\n\\n**dashpole** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T16:12:33Z\\n\\n**MrAlias** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T16:34:09Z\\n\\n**dashpole** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T17:34:51Z\\n\\n**dashpole** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T20:12:48Z\\n\\n**MrAlias** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-03T22:44:49Z\\n\\n**dashpole** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-04T03:45:24Z\\n\\n**MrAlias** — APPROVED — 2025-10-07T15:50:33Z\\n\\n**bboreham** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-12T21:22:58Z\\n\\n**dashpole** — COMMENTED — 2025-10-15T01:06:50Z\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"dmathieu if you have the chanc to review this is relat to other optim pr dashpol 2025 12 11t20 43 53z i figur out whi the benchmark result were so poor the benchmark wa record all observ in a singl bucket and each bucket ha it own lock so there were effect no parallel gain i switch the benchmark to record observ in differ bucket and that show that this is a 70 perform improv when exemplar are be record sourc id src pr 05 pull request optim histogram reservoir open telemetri opentelemetri go 7443 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7443 author dashpol creat 2025 10 02t13 56 40z updat 2025 12 15t15 00 11z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state merg 2025 12 15t14 59 34z branch optim _ histogram _ reservoir main chang 173 61 across 8 file label mileston v1 400 review 19 mralia comment 2025 10 03t16 04 21z dashpol comment 2025 10 03t16 12 33z mralia comment 2025 10 03t16 34 09z dashpol comment 2025 10 03t1